# Each gateway username MUST equal its registered node ID.
# Provision password entries using mosquitto_passwd; never allow anonymous access.
pattern write compallette/v1/gateways/%u/events
pattern write compallette/v1/gateways/%u/results
pattern read compallette/v1/gateways/%u/receipts
pattern read compallette/v1/gateways/%u/commands

user compallette-ingestion
topic read compallette/v1/gateways/+/events
topic read compallette/v1/gateways/+/results
topic write compallette/v1/gateways/+/receipts
topic write compallette/v1/gateways/+/commands
